30	const CYCLE_GUIDELINES = [
31	  "Integrated Pi cycle: these instructions govern cycle-attributed work only. Standalone web tools remain available without a cycle; with an active cycle, unrelated requests use researchMode=standalone and omit cycle references.",
32	  "Integrated Pi cycle: clarify unresolved goals, scope, constraints and output contract while refining an explicitly requested cycle. If none is active, ask the operator to start with /exa-research start <topic> or explicitly resume saved state. Local exa_research_* planning tools never call Exa; explicitly approved cycle-attributed web_* retrievals can gather evidence during planning.",
